[2026-08-19T04:37:41.726Z] {"timestamp":1787114260127,"type":"fetch","method":"GET","url":"/api/trpc/store.products?batch=1&input=%7B%220%22%3A%7B%22json%22%3A%7B%22category%22%3A%22wet-cans%22%2C%22q%22%3A%22%22%7D%7D%7D","request":{"headers":{},"body":null},"response":{"status":200,"statusText":"OK","headers":{"connection":"keep-alive","content-type":"application/json","date":"Wed, 19 Aug 2026 04:37:40 GMT","keep-alive":"timeout=5","transfer-encoding":"chunked","vary":"trpc-accept, accept","x-powered-by":"Express"},"body":"[{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"json\":{\"products\":[{\"id\":\"prod_V5Cy07SyT7B6gF\",\"name\":\"CIAO 貓罐罐 - 白肉金槍魚、鰹魚乾 85g  x 6個\",\"description\":\"經典白肉金槍魚罐底，點綴香醇鰹魚乾，是 CIAO 最耐看的日常味道。湯汁清亮、肉質細緻，適合當作每週濕食輪替的主力款。綠茶消臭成分照顧家居氣味，讓開罐時刻既幸福、也安心。\",\"image\":\"https://mofuhavenhk.com/images/products/wt-product-10.jpg\",\"images\":[\"https://mofuhavenhk.com/images/products/wt-product-10.jpg\"],\"priceId\":\"price_1U52Y8RyM6dRKLtZwpSBdLy9\",\"unitAmount\":7800,\"currency\":\"hkd\",\"active\":true,\"metadata\":{\"Categories\":\"貓咪商品\",\"Category\":\"貓咪商品\",\"Parent_Category\":\"貓咪商品\",\"SubCategory\":\"貓罐頭\",\"category\":\"cats\",\"category_slug\":\"cats\",\"child_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"id\":\"wt-product-10\",\"is_active\":\"true\",\"parent_category\":\"cats\",\"slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"status\":\"active\",\"subCategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"sub_category\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory\":\"wet-cans\",\"subcategory_alt\":\"罐罐 / 濕糧\",\"subcategory_slug\":\"wet-cans\",\"tag\":\"貓咪商品\",\"tags\":\"貓咪商品\",\"type\":\"wet-cans\"}},{\"id\":\"prod_V5Cy3t0lLGQBH1\",\"name\":\"CIAO 貓罐罐 - 白肉金槍魚、越光米 85g  x 6個\",\"description\":\"柔滑白肉金槍魚遇見日本越光米的溫潤口感，質地綿密、好吞嚥，適合需要溫和腸胃體驗或偏好軟食的貓咪。魚肉提供優質蛋白，米粒增添飽足層次，是節奏較慢、愛慢慢品嚐的毛孩的安心選擇。\",\"image\":\"https://mofuhavenhk.com/images/products/wt-product-9.jpg\",\"images\":[\"https://mofuhavenhk.com/images/products/wt-product-9.jpg\"],\"priceId\":\"price_1U52Y7RyM6dRKLtZYlnwdHlL\",\"unitAmount\":7800,\"currency\":\"hkd\",\"active\":true,\"metadata\":{\"Categories\"